# Description:
# ------------
# Initialize and enter a chroot environment safely.
#
# This script validates the target directory, verifies root privileges, and
# binds essential system directories (dev, proc, sys, run) before dropping into
# an interactive shell. It implements an EXIT trap to ensures that all bind
# mounts are cleanly unmounted when the user exits the chroot session.
#
# Usage: chroot-enter <chroot_directory>
